# Pinned third-party deps. Single source of truth — every build script
# resolves through scripts/lib/deps.sh, which clones the named repo and
# verifies HEAD matches the commit below. See AGENTS.md "Vendored Deps".
#
# When updating a dep:
#   1. cd <dest>; git checkout <new commit>; iterate; commit upstream
#   2. update the commit column here
#   3. run `scripts/update-deps.sh` on every checkout
#
# An out-of-band update (HEAD moved without bumping this file, or this
# file moved without running update-deps) is a build-time error.
#
# Fields are tab-separated:
#   name <TAB> repo <TAB> commit <TAB> ref-hint <TAB> dest
#
# - name      : short identifier used by build scripts (`dep_ensure NAME`)
# - repo      : git URL
# - commit    : full sha-1 of the pinned tip. Verified bit-for-bit.
# - ref-hint  : branch or tag the commit lives on; passed to `git fetch`
#               so we don't have to fetch every ref. Use "-" if unknown
#               (we'll fall back to `git fetch origin` and `--unshallow`).
# - dest      : checkout path, relative to the repo root.
#
# Tarball deps (talloc) are not listed here — their version is
# baked into the URL inside the build script, so version bumps trigger
# a fresh download by construction.
#
# The X11 / Wayland / Mesa-gfxstream / smithay / libxkbcommon pins are
# gone with the compositor (TAWC_DSH_DESIGN.md §11): they existed to
# cross-build a display stack, and DSH only wants Vulkan compute.

# name              repo                                                                  commit                                      ref-hint                       dest
libhybris	https://github.com/wmww/libhybris.git	23e12ca8f558e25c07dd0c1263da8075fd4e4c8b	master	deps/libhybris
android-headers	https://github.com/Halium/android-headers.git	2c6ac3dcc4f8db593dd69906b0ec22822abfed91	halium-11.0	deps/android-headers
proot	https://github.com/termux/proot.git	ab2e3464d04483b98a0614b470f3f8950d5a6468	master	deps/proot
termux-app	https://github.com/termux/termux-app.git	401bbe54b8f4e68302b1ff70678015a24628fb1d	master	deps/termux-app
cleat	https://codeberg.org/sphi/cleat.git	f53455f54700d7238097f903f461b85b41bfbd38	main	deps/cleat
debootstrap	https://salsa.debian.org/installer-team/debootstrap.git	9c1e17bc3557efdf59468cfdc24ca0497f3b90f4	master	deps/debootstrap

# Turnip (freedreno Vulkan) for the TURNIP graphics backend — a Mesa
# checkout, built with -Dvulkan-drivers=freedreno and no WSI. This is
# the only Mesa pin left: the gfxstream/Zink backends that used the
# `mesa` 25.3.6 tree went with the compositor. See
# TAWC_DSH_DESIGN.md §11.1 and scripts/build-turnip.sh.
mesa-turnip	https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa.git	3281a69a8bfd9f997e91c15ed0e6290cae12dd32	mesa-26.2.2	deps/mesa-turnip
